[{"id":"1779787403670-","time":1779787403671,"userMessage":"","botResponse":"10進数の 400 を16進数で表示すると：\n0x190\nになります。\nC++で確認すると：\nC++#include <iostream>using namespace std;int main() {    int x = 400;    cout << \"0x\" << hex << x << endl;}\n出力：\n0x190\n\n変換の内訳は：\n400 ÷ 16 = 25 余り 025 ÷ 16 = 1 余り 91 ÷ 16 = 0 余り 1\n逆順に読むので：\n190\nつまり：\n400(10) = 0x190(16)","codeBlocks":[{"code":"0x190","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"0x190","language":"","parentId":"1779787403670-","turnParentId":"33d213b7-7608-407b-b220-4f171e7ef58b"},{"code":"#include <iostream>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    int x = 400;\n\n    cout << \"0x\" << hex << x << endl;\n}","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"#include <iostream>\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    int x = 400;\n\n    cout << \"0x\" << hex << x << endl;\n}","language":"","parentId":"1779787403670-","turnParentId":"33d213b7-7608-407b-b220-4f171e7ef58b"},{"code":"0x190","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"0x190","language":"","parentId":"1779787403670-","turnParentId":"33d213b7-7608-407b-b220-4f171e7ef58b"},{"code":"400 ÷ 16 = 25 余り 0\n25 ÷ 16 = 1 余り 9\n1 ÷ 16 = 0 余り 1","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"400 ÷ 16 = 25 余り 0\n25 ÷ 16 = 1 余り 9\n1 ÷ 16 = 0 余り 1","language":"","parentId":"1779787403670-","turnParentId":"33d213b7-7608-407b-b220-4f171e7ef58b"},{"code":"190","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"190","language":"","parentId":"1779787403670-","turnParentId":"33d213b7-7608-407b-b220-4f171e7ef58b"},{"code":"400(10) = 0x190(16)","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"400(10) = 0x190(16)","language":"","parentId":"1779787403670-","turnParentId":"33d213b7-7608-407b-b220-4f171e7ef58b"}]},{"id":"1779787403672-3桁に統一する方法はありますか0x000のようｎ","time":1779787403673,"userMessage":"3桁に統一する方法はありますか0x000のようｎ","botResponse":"はい。setw と setfill を使うと、0x000 のように桁数を固定できます。\n例えば「16進数部分を3桁固定」にするなら：\nC++#include <iostream>#include <iomanip>using namespace std;int main() {    int x = 5;    cout << \"0x\"         << setw(3)         << setfill('0')         << hex         << x         << endl;}\n出力：\n0x005\n\n例\nC++0   -> 0x0005   -> 0x00515  -> 0x00f255 -> 0x0ff400 -> 0x190\n\n大文字版\nC++cout << \"0x\"     << uppercase     << setw(3)     << setfill('0')     << hex     << x;\n出力：\n0x0FF\n\n4桁固定なら\nC++setw(4)\n0x0005\n\nよくある罠\nsetw() は「次の1回の出力」にしか効きません。\nなので：\nC++cout << setw(3) << x << y;\nだと x にしか適用されません。","codeBlocks":[{"code":"#include <iostream>\n#include <iomanip>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    int x = 5;\n\n    cout << \"0x\"\n         << setw(3)\n         << setfill('0')\n         << hex\n         << x\n         << endl;\n}","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"#include <iostream>\n#include <iomanip>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nint main() {\n    int x = 5;\n\n    cout << \"0x\"\n         << setw(3)\n         << setfill('0')\n         << hex\n         << x\n         << endl;\n}","language":"","parentId":"1779787403672-3桁に統一する方法はありますか0x000のようｎ","turnParentId":"d23dc075-0133-40fb-be55-504a97b3ee0e"},{"code":"0x005","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"0x005","language":"","parentId":"1779787403672-3桁に統一する方法はありますか0x000のようｎ","turnParentId":"d23dc075-0133-40fb-be55-504a97b3ee0e"},{"code":"0   -> 0x000\n5   -> 0x005\n15  -> 0x00f\n255 -> 0x0ff\n400 -> 0x190","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"0   -> 0x000\n5   -> 0x005\n15  -> 0x00f\n255 -> 0x0ff\n400 -> 0x190","language":"","parentId":"1779787403672-3桁に統一する方法はありますか0x000のようｎ","turnParentId":"d23dc075-0133-40fb-be55-504a97b3ee0e"},{"code":"cout << \"0x\"\n     << uppercase\n     << setw(3)\n     << setfill('0')\n     << hex\n     << x;","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"cout << \"0x\"\n     << uppercase\n     << setw(3)\n     << setfill('0')\n     << hex\n     << x;","language":"","parentId":"1779787403672-3桁に統一する方法はありますか0x000のようｎ","turnParentId":"d23dc075-0133-40fb-be55-504a97b3ee0e"},{"code":"0x0FF","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"0x0FF","language":"","parentId":"1779787403672-3桁に統一する方法はありますか0x000のようｎ","turnParentId":"d23dc075-0133-40fb-be55-504a97b3ee0e"},{"code":"setw(4)","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"setw(4)","language":"","parentId":"1779787403672-3桁に統一する方法はありますか0x000のようｎ","turnParentId":"d23dc075-0133-40fb-be55-504a97b3ee0e"},{"code":"0x0005","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"0x0005","language":"","parentId":"1779787403672-3桁に統一する方法はありますか0x000のようｎ","turnParentId":"d23dc075-0133-40fb-be55-504a97b3ee0e"},{"code":"cout << setw(3) << x << y;","codeRef":null,"copied":false,"surroundingText":"cout << setw(3) << x << y;","language":"","parentId":"1779787403672-3桁に統一する方法はありますか0x000のようｎ","turnParentId":"d23dc075-0133-40fb-be55-504a97b3ee0e"}]}]